    "SWEEP_SOLID": {
      "description": "Sweep a closed profile along a guide path. Twist angle adds rotation along the path. Lock-to-profile keeps the profile plane orientation fixed (orthogonal to path). Continuity controls profile-edge-tangency at path joints.",
